\tag{fdip}
\title{Transported pairs and their coefficients}
\date{2026-11-17}

\p{The [paired coefficient](fdip-00TJ) contracts a universal
odd covector with a universal odd vector. For fields at
different vertices, the [coefficient connection](fdip-00SH)
specifies which fiber map can stand between them. The order
of those two odd factors determines the sign of the resulting
inverse-kernel entry.}

\transclude{fdip-00WC}
